# Internal hostnames, written to /etc/hosts between KI markers.
# Format: <Tailscale IP> <name> [<name> ...]   One entry per line.
# Applied by bootstrap.sh and daily by ki-sync; removing a line removes it from
# every laptop at the next sync.
#
# Normally empty: staging names are in public DNS pointing at Tailscale IPs, so
# every tailnet device (phones, Windows) resolves them the same way. Only add a
# name here if it has no DNS record, and keep it in sync with the Tailscale IP.
